6
00:00:23.396 --> 00:00:26.522
Dave: Yeah, this looks different.

7
00:00:26.523 --> 00:00:30.803
Chuck: I remember there was a flash of lightning.

8
00:00:30.804 --> 00:00:36.609
Dave: That's right. And Danny was pointing that toy gun at

9
00:00:36.610 --> 00:00:39.661
us. Chuck: Do you think the gun actually did

10
00:00:39.662 --> 00:00:44.313
something? Dave: Of course not. It was just a stupid

11
00:00:44.314 --> 00:00:48.789
toy. Chuck: But this grass is really, really

12
00:00:48.790 --> 00:00:56.369
tall. Dave: Maybe . . . maybe the lightning made the grass grow super

13
00:00:56.370 --> 00:01:02.482
tall. Chuck: I don't know,

14
00:01:02.483 --> 00:01:07.546
maybe. Dave: Where did that come

15
00:01:07.547 --> 00:01:15.402
from? Chuck: Hey! What's going

16
00:01:15.403 --> 00:01:23.956
on? Dave: Take

17
00:01:23.957 --> 00:01:27.267
cover! I think the falling water has stopped.

18
00:01:27.268 --> 00:01:34.518
Chuck: Something very, very weird is going on.

19
00:01:34.519 --> 00:01:37.664
Dave: Maybe it's just a dream.

20
00:01:37.665 --> 00:01:42.344
Chuck: That must be the explanation, except for one thing.

21
00:01:42.345 --> 00:01:44.487
Dave: What's that?

22
00:01:44.488 --> 00:01:48.532
Chuck: How can we both be having the same dream?

23
00:01:48.533 --> 00:01:56.554
