But if we're dreaming . . . Dave:

32
00:02:29.408 --> 00:02:31.040
Yes . . . Chuck:

33
00:02:31.041 --> 00:02:33.992
Then it wouldn't hurt if I pinched you, would it? Dave:

34
00:02:33.993 --> 00:02:36.621
No, it wouldn't. Chuck:

35
00:02:36.622 --> 00:02:39.487
Let's try it. Dave:

36
00:02:39.488 --> 00:02:42.829
Ow! That hurts! Chuck:

37
00:02:42.830 --> 00:02:46.155
Hey! What did you do that for? Dave:

38
00:02:46.156 --> 00:02:51.787
You started it! Chuck:

39
00:02:51.788 --> 00:02:53.506
Wait a second! Dave:

40
00:02:53.507 --> 00:02:54.537
What? Chuck:

41
00:02:54.538 --> 00:02:57.077
Do you know what this means? Dave:

42
00:02:57.078 --> 00:03:00.267
Yeah. It means I'm going to get you! Chuck:

43
00:03:00.268 --> 00:03:04.377
No! It means we're not dreaming!

44
00:03:04.378 --> 00:03:08.861
Dave: So . . . if we're not dreaming . . .

45
00:03:08.862 --> 00:03:12.363
Chuck: Then everything around us is real.

46
00:03:12.364 --> 00:03:18.571
Dave: We are in a strange new land with super tall grass.

47
00:03:18.572 --> 00:03:22.151
Chuck: Yes, everything looks strange.

48
00:03:22.152 --> 00:03:26.901
But for some reason, it feels familiar.

49
00:03:26.902 --> 00:03:28.958
Dave: What was that?

50
00:03:28.959 --> 00:03:37.758
Chuck: I wonder if we are in danger.

51
00:03:37.759 --> 00:03:42.060
Chuck & Dave: Aaah!

